  "caption_latex": "\\textbf{Environmental transport changes many-body correlations.} Twenty-spin nonlinear HOPS--MPS calculations with a $z$-N\\'eel initial state. The transverse XXZ model has $\\Delta=2$, $F_i=gS_i^x$ and $\\omega_c=5J$; the exchange Heisenberg model has $\\Delta=1$, $F_i=gS_i^-$ and zero rotating-frame cavity detuning. Both use $g=2J$, amplitude loss $\\gamma=0.1J$ and $J_b=0,\\pm2J$. {(a,b):} Signed spatial correlation profiles at $Jt=1$. {(c):} Transverse $yy$ correlation at separation three. {(d):} Staggered order for exchange coupling. Every panel retains its bathless control. Bands are pointwise 95\\% normal-approximation intervals."
